# Canonical test route — Spike 0 reference manifest.
# docs/viewport-expansion-research-plan.md §10. Run with:
#   tools/capture/run_route.sh <output-dir>
# which starts from NO save file (blank EEPROM) — the fixture state is
# "deterministic new game, file 'A', story position: Picori Festival".
#
# Frame numbers assume the exact input sequence below from process start;
# any edit above a line shifts everything after it. The engine RNG is
# constant-seeded (gRand=0x1234567, src/main.c) so runs are byte-identical.
#
# Waypoints (11): title, fileselect, cutscene (Picori legend), textbox
# (Zelda at Link's house), field, woods, lightray (Minish Woods west),
# deepwood, town (festival), pause, figurine.

# --- title / file select / new game ---
940 dump title
960 keys START
964 keys NONE
1080 dump fileselect
1150 keys A
1154 keys NONE
1300 keys A
1304 keys NONE
1450 keys START
1454 keys NONE

